.TH hyphen-man 1 "November 13, 2023"
.SH NAME
\fBhyphen-man\fR - formatting hyphens and breaking lines
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a long line of text, such that the last word won't fit: break-here
.PP
Tqy the same thing once again, but this time in italic font mode:
\fIbreak-here\fP
.PP
Finally, try again a890:x
.TE
.ll 78n
.PP
Now we abold font mode:
\fBbreak-here\fP
